{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02750","headline":"中和乐九章 歌储宫第六 · 卢照邻","name":"中和乐九章 歌储宫第六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"波澄少海，景丽前星。\n高禖诞圣，甲观昇灵。\n承规翠所，问寝瑶庭。\n宗儒侧席，问道横经。\n山宾皎皎，国胄青青。\n黄裳元吉，邦家以宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}